DESCRIPTION:Chris D'Elia has become one of the most in-demand performers in
  comedy. His highly successful podcast CONGRATULATIONS WITH CHRIS D'ELIA ha
 s been a mainstay on iTunes' comedy podcast charts since its debut in Febru
 ary 2017. He is also a co star on THE GOLDEN HOUR with Brendan Schaub and E
 rik Griffin.\n\nAs a stand-up comedian\, D'Elia has toured the US and Canad
 a. D'Elia has three comedy specials available on Netflix\, NO PAIN (2020)\,
  MAN ON FIRE (2017)\, INCORRIGIBLE (2015)\, and he was chosen as one of fou
 r comics to represent the US in Netflix's 2019 Series COMEDIANS OF THE WORL
 D which features 47 comedians from 13 regions in eight different languages.
  His first special\, WHITE MALE\, BLACK COMIC\, debuted on Comedy Central i
 n 2013 and he can be seen on Comedy Central's ROAST OF JUSTIN BIEBER (2015)
 .\n\nD'Elia is also a father to sons\, Calvin\, born in 2020\, and William\
 , born in 2023.\n\nCouples Package includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 fo
 od & beverage credit ($45 per person)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection\n\n*
 *The Private Skybox Suite includes up to 10 tickets\, a $400 Food & Beverag
 e voucher\, a personal server\, a private restroom\, and all gratuity charg
 es.\n\nAny additional food and drink costs above $400 will be billed at the
  end of the show. The guest count can not exceed 10 people. All club polici
 es and safety guidelines will be enforced. Please note that the skybox is o
 n the second floor of our showroom\, and is NOT wheelchair accessible.\n\nM
 anagement reserves the right to prevent customers from entering the facilit
 y who they deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https
 ://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/special-event-chris-d-elia-24966/
